@ref O 41 r 2(2) (src:5816)
GIVEN `what is to be registered is a transfer` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the due execution of the transfer is proved by affidavit` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 41 r 2(2) the receiver's duty to send a notice before registering a transfer arises` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (NOT `what is to be registered is a transfer`)
           THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Before registering a transfer"
           IF `the due execution of the transfer is proved by affidavit`
