       AND notice's `o 41 r 2(2)(a) it states that an application for the registration of the transfer has been made`
       AND notice's `o 41 r 2(2)(b) it states that the transfer will be registered unless within the period specified in the notice the holder informs the receiver that the holder objects to the registration`
    THEN JUST TRUE
