@ref O 41 r 2(3) (src:5820)
GIVEN `the last day of the period specified in the notice` IS A DATE
      `o 3 r 3 the first day on which the act may be done` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 41 r 2(3) the period specified in the notice is long enough` MEANS
    IF `the last day of the period specified in the notice` AT LEAST `o 3 r 3 the first day on which the act may be done`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "must be at least 14 days after a reply from the registered holder would in the ordinary course of post reach the receiver"

