    `o 41 r 5(4) has preserved every certificate of identification produced under paragraph (2)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 41 r 5(4) has kept a record of the debentures and certificates produced, of the names and addresses of the persons producing them and of the holders` IS A BOOLEAN

